this guest with us today, Dr. Christopher M.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:31.500
Palmer. Dr. Christopher Palmer is a Harvard&nbsp;
psychiatrist and researcher working at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.000
interface of metabolism and mental health. And&nbsp;
he probably doesn't know this, but I have wanted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.200
to have him on for probably six to 12 months&nbsp;
and have been looking for the right window&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.120
and the right context. We'll come back to that.
