00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:50.100
Postgraduate and Continuing Education at McLean&nbsp;
Hospital and an assistant professor of psychiatry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:54.360
at Harvard Medical School. For over 25 years,&nbsp;
he's held administrative, educational, research,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:58.200
and clinical roles in psychiatry at Harvard.
