my mom actually is a woman who had two lives. And&nbsp;
the first part of her life, up until about age 42,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:31.380
was that she wanted a simple middle-class&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:39.960
family life. She and my father wanted a big&nbsp;
family. They were Catholic. They wanted four&nbsp;&nbsp;

