And it was the second coming of&nbsp;
Christ, and she was somehow involved.&nbsp;

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:08.640
She would get paranoid, and she&nbsp;
became convinced that my father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:15.540
