00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:41.880
She worked various part-time jobs and bought a&nbsp;
small home and paid for it with her own money.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:48.300
And she inherited a chunk of money from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:54.540
my grandfather, a hundred thousand dollars.&nbsp;
But she was extraordinarily frugal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:57.300
so that was enough for her to live on&nbsp;
for pretty much the rest of her life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:06.660
And she had obesity and diabetes and eventually&nbsp;
a massive heart attack and died of heart failure.&nbsp;

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:10.260
Tim Ferriss: Thank you for&nbsp;
being willing to share that.&nbsp;

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:14.400
Dr. Christopher Palmer: Sure.
Tim Ferriss: And it's hard to&nbsp;&nbsp;

