00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:16.320
be listening who are either directly affected&nbsp;
personally or directly affected with family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:23.280
members or somehow indirectly affected by what we&nbsp;
would consider psychiatric disorders or psychotic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:31.080
disorders. It is incredibly, incredibly prevalent.
And this might be a clumsy segue, but I do think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:37.200
it could be a helpful one, especially&nbsp;
for those who feel lost in a world of&nbsp;&nbsp;

