for working into some valuable terrain.
How did that first end up on your radar?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:47.940
Was it because of patients like Doris, if&nbsp;
I'm remembering her name correctly, who were&nbsp;&nbsp;

