be on the smaller side. And just so people know,&nbsp;
and please correct me if I'm getting this wrong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:33.840 --> 01:02:40.740
but the reason a lot of folks have an aversion,&nbsp;
I think a lot of it is cultural conditioning to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:40.740 --> 01:02:49.800
attempt to do ketosis by simply going low carb and&nbsp;
they end up going very, very high protein. So they&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:49.800 --> 01:02:57.780
think that they can do green salad with a mountain&nbsp;
