01:02:57.780 --> 01:03:05.280
body's really crafty. It happens to like ATP. So&nbsp;
the body will take the excess protein or a portion&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:05.280 --> 01:03:10.620
of it and convert it in the liver, I think,&nbsp;
through a process called glucogenesis to glucose.&nbsp;

01:03:10.620 --> 01:03:16.200
So then oops, you end up not being able to&nbsp;
