01:03:16.200 --> 01:03:22.140
your body just does not need them. If you have&nbsp;
high glucose levels, your body is getting what it&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:22.140 --> 01:03:25.980
needs and your body's pretty smart about resource&nbsp;
allocation. Let's talk, definitely feel free,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:25.980 --> 01:03:31.140
if there's anything you'd like to add to that.&nbsp;
Any other common mistakes that you observe or&nbsp;&nbsp;

