things that people don't think will affect ketosis&nbsp;
that tends to affect ketosis in unexpected ways?&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:37.320 --> 01:03:43.140
Any common pitfalls you'd like to highlight?
Dr. Christopher Palmer: Honestly, there are so&nbsp;&nbsp;

